  "description": "The proposal is for the change of use of the property from a single dwellinghouse (Use Class C3) to a small-scale residential children’s care home (Use Class C2) accommodating up to 2 children.\n\nThe property will provide a stable, home-like environment for children in care, with support provided by a small, consistent staff team. Staffing will include daytime support, with one sleep-in staff member and one waking night staff member to ensure appropriate safeguarding.\n\nThe scale of the use is modest and comparable to that of a typical family dwelling. The number of occupants will be low and the overall level of activity is not expected to exceed that of a standard residential property.\n\nNo external alterations are proposed and the residential character of the property and surrounding area will be preserved. The use is not expected to result in any significant increase in noise, traffic, or disturbance.",
